.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7cbca117e27d1f79b4c44a08ec3ebe7e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-08T09:45:47.000Z"},{"id":"HBl4AwZJ7","title":"Navigating Docker With Captains Ep. 05 with Edith Puclla","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-captains-05-edith/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/navigating-docker-with-captains-ep-05-with-edith-puclla-hbl4awzj7","summary":"Episode 5 of 'Navigating Docker With Captains' features an interview with Edith Puclla, a Docker Captain, CNCF Ambassador, and Technology Evangelist at Percona. The episode discusses Edith's journey in Docker and Kubernetes, the importance of teamwork and inclusivity in engineering culture, and highlights lesser-known Docker features.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/639baca6d60aa5028ed383ed026dcab4?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-08T09:10:56.000Z"},{"id":"BtIS5UnN8","title":"Navigating Docker With Captains Ep. 04 with Bret Fisher","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-captains-04-bret/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/navigating-docker-with-captains-ep-04-with-bret-fisher-btis5unn8","summary":"This post is part of the 'Navigating Docker With Captains' series and features an interview with Docker Captain Bret Fisher. The episode discusses Bret's journey with Docker, his experiences in DevOps, and his upcoming projects and new Docker features in 2024.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7d08071615457b1a7193c756812781ee?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-01-30T11:57:18.000Z"},{"id":"QgracxVNN","title":"feat: Deploy To Cloud - The Latest Updates to the Livecycle Docker Extension","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-deploy-to-cloud/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/feat-deploy-to-cloud---the-latest-updates-to-the-livecycle-docker-extension-qgracxvnn","summary":"Livecycle has introduced the Livecycle Docker Extension, which enables developers to share local development environments for collaboration and feedback. The extension now includes a 'Deploy to Cloud' feature that allows users to deploy applications on AWS, GCP, Azure, or Kubernetes for long-term review and feedback.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/79ac76860f1d4138c6dd7fd7609b0b75?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-27T20:53:36.000Z"},{"id":"rVwhFgRcM","title":"Share Your Docker Compose App Terminal Remotely","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-remote-terminal/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/share-your-docker-compose-app-terminal-remotely-rvwhfgrcm","summary":"Share your Docker Compose App terminal remotely with the Livecycle Docker Extension, which allows you to easily share your local work and collaborate with others. The extension provides a preview URL and access to the Livecycle Dashboard, which offers collaboration tools such as a remote terminal and logging.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1f3dc48f060c81b4bfff997f9bccd2bf?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":10,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-01-04T08:59:29.000Z"},{"id":"d3QY5VamE","title":"How to Get Previews for Every Pull Request Using Preevy + GitHub Actions + Google Cloud","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/how-to-get-previews-per-pull-request-gcp-gha","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-get-previews-for-every-pull-request-using-preevy-github-actions-google-cloud-d3qy5vame","summary":"Learn how to use Preevy, an open source CLI tool, to easily provision and manage ephemeral environments for containerized applications in the cloud. Integrate Preevy with GitHub Actions and Google Cloud for a seamless pull request workflow. Also, find out how to delete GH deployments and environments on PR closure.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e781331165b6c49f14b65e181f8d6898?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-25T12:52:28.000Z"},{"id":"bjtd1UtOq","title":"8 Docker Extensions to Use in 2024","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-extensions-2024","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/8-docker-extensions-to-use-in-2024-bjtd1utoq","summary":"Discover 8 Docker Extensions that can improve your productivity and overall developer experience, including Livecycle for sharing docker-compose apps, JMeter for load testing, ContainerWatch for monitoring container usage, Docketeer for detailed metrics, PGAdmin for Postgres database management, Portainer for easy container management, Snyk for security checks, and Excalidraw for local drawing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e3193b4644c87ee19ef1a7a957a4cb4f?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":77,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2023-12-19T12:01:22.000Z"},{"id":"w5iCOZMHJ","title":"Navigating Docker With Captains Ep. 03 with Mohammad Ali","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-captains-03-mohammad","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/navigating-docker-with-captains-ep-03-with-mohammad-ali-w5icozmhj","summary":"The article is an interview with Mohammad Ali, a Docker Captain, who discusses his journey with Docker, his involvement in the Docker community, and his current project of writing a book on supply chain security.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6bfbe5d7f089e554c0b840f8df403988?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2023-12-14T07:26:14.000Z"},{"id":"JXcUfImJE","title":"How to Get Preview Environments for Every Pull Request","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/ephemeral-environments-for-every-pull-request","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-get-preview-environments-for-every-pull-request-jxcufimje","summary":"Learn how to easily create preview environments for every pull request using the open-source tool Preevy. Preview environments are production-like environments that allow for easy review and testing of code changes before merging to master. Preevy is a CLI tool that simplifies the process of provisioning and managing preview environments in the cloud, making it accessible for both technical and non-technical users.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/881c1fc20cb97394d636eb6dc0af66ca?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2023-12-12T14:17:53.000Z"},{"id":"pSEUOkZ1Z","title":"Get In-flight Collaboration for Your AI/ML Stack on Docker","url":"https://livecycle.io/blogs/docker-hackathon","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/get-in-flight-collaboration-for-your-ai-ml-stack-on-docker-pseuokz1z","summary":"Docker recently completed their AI/ML Hackathon, where participants built innovative solutions using Docker technology. The hackathon focused on improving developer productivity and included sessions on building higher-quality products. The Livecycle Docker Extension was presented as a tool for achieving a fast collaborative experience, allowing teams to instantly share changes and save time during the hackathon.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/292da800ea33469befbacbabbe9fe89c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-09T09:14:05.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["dhh","duckdb","jeffgeerling","supabase","platformatic"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","hamelhusain","xai","hwchase17","sama"],"similar":[{"id":"dhh","handle":"dhh","name":"David Heinemeier Hansson","is_squad":false,"x":-5.3725,"y":4.8233,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":357,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/b7c11ef4e9954addbc4857515fd21609","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":1.843202,"median_upvotes":11.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.011204,"avg_read_time":2.628571,"tag_diversity":0.414566},"top_tags_preview":[["linux",35],["o